/Title (A related, separate issue is that not all attributes should count equally toward similarity even when they are all comparable: a recommendation engine might reasonably want to weight recent_purchases far more heavily than signup_year. Weighted Minkowski distance and weighted cosine similarity handle this directly by attaching an explicit weight to each attribute's contribution. )
