/Title (This treats the gap between "fair" and "good" as exactly the same size as the gap between "OK" and "wonderful" - both differences of 2 map to a dissimilarity of 0.5. Whether that assumption is reasonable is a judgment call, not a mathematical fact: ordinal encodings impose equal spacing on categories that were never guaranteed to be equally spaced. )
