<<
/Title (A subtler trap involves shifting rather than scaling. Take a product photo x, and a version y with every pixel value shifted up by a constant \(uniformly brighter\). Cosine similarity between the raw pixel vectors is not invariant to this: an additive shift changes each vector's direction, not just its length. )
/Dest [31 0 R /XYZ 72.187988 310.51563 0]
