893 0 obj
<<
/Title (The same underlying relationship reported in two different unit systems: raw covariance changes drastically with units, while correlation does not. )
/Dest [27 0 R /XYZ 72.66333 717.27246 0]
/Parent 4 0 R
/SE 174 0 R
/Prev 895 0 R
/Next 891 0 R
>>
endobj
894 0 obj
<<
/Title (Cosine similarity is now the default distance measure of modern AI, because it is the only measure introduced so far that is built specifically for high-dimensional, sparse, direction-matters data - exactly the shape of a text embedding. It underlies ChatGPT-style embedding comparisons, sentence transformers \(trained so that cosine similarity between outputs matches human judgements of meaning\), retrieval-augmented generation \(ranking which document chunks to hand an LLM before it answers\), semantic search \(matching "running shoes" to "jogging sneakers", which is impossible for keyword search but easy for cosine on embeddings\), and vector databases such as FAISS, Qdrant and Milvus, which are built almost entirely around computing this one formula at enormous scale. )
/Dest [21 0 R /XYZ 72.177246 153.961914 0]
/Parent 4 0 R
/SE 132 0 R
/Prev 892 0 R
/Next 896 0 R
>>
endobj
895 0 obj
