<<
/Title (y = x squared: a perfect, fully deterministic relationship, yet Pearson correlation is close to zero because the relationship is not linear. )
/Dest [26 0 R /XYZ 72.097412 374.77539 0]
/Parent 4 0 R
/SE 169 0 R
/Prev 905 0 R
/Next 901 0 R
>>
endobj
904 0 obj
<<
/Title (A lighting change shifts one embedding dimension so much that, under naive Euclidean distance, Person A appears more dissimilar to themselves than to a different person, Person B. )
/Dest [22 0 R /XYZ 71.749512 170.88672 0]
/Parent 4 0 R
/SE 137 0 R
/Prev 902 0 R
